      "Anchor": "module-6---notifications",
      "SectionPath": [],
      "Text": "Upon completing development, to ensure official certification of Module 6, please review each of the test cases mentioned below. To ensure an efficient meeting or review of the recorded demo shared via the partner support form, please review all appropriate documentation and send technical questions to your Business Development and/or Partner Engineering representative beforehand.",
      "Headers": [],
      "Rows": []
